Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:55.22,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(1061,0)\t(1019,1061,\1a&H00&)}You're Fired
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, I think I know\Nthat guy with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's one of Straw Hat Luffy's\Nhenchmen, Pirate Hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Henchman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.70,0:02:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least he recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not even a henchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Pirate A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe B.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, when I get a bounty, it's\Ngoing to be twice as much as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, Pirate C.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop changing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A, stop you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think they can\Nhear you, Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.73,0:02:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but it sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more of them over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's be hiding on a train!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow it up! Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's still inside there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sniper King?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never better, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! She's far!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See it for yourself! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot. I'm just an old ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little girl, the kitty cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too cute to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The straw-hack pirates threatened\Nto do all kinds of rude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and immoral stuff if I didn't\Noperate the train for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those meanies! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would let their hostages\Nget drunk? That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost blew up that innocent old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of deranged monster\Nwould take a senior citizen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little girl, and a cat as hostages? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is that\Nsmoke forming a cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using cool balls and heat balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can turn the moisture\Nin the air into clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, Nami Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd make it out okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't name it the perfect\Nclimate act for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These clouds are growing a lot\Nbigger and faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, how strong\Nare the Thunderbolts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is looking scary, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably better to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause here comes the new Thunderbolt Tipo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to kill me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, why'd you hit Sniper King?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you don't\Nknow how to use it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Usopp told me he never\Nadded a feature like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, that thing is crazy powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Nami, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you aim that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him, Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You apologize, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't felt a shock like that since\Nthe first time I met you, Nami Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are out\Nof control! It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that girl was just a navigator,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it turns out she's just\Nas strong as the rest of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, what about our captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any guesses on where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island's pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's definitely where he's at!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You filthy criminals think the Watch\NDogs will let you do as you please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,715)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord2.2\xshad-1\yshad1\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(475,0)\t(434,475,\1a&H00&)}Main Island, Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\fscx150\fscy150\bord0\blur0.8\b600\pos(960,715)\c&HE5E5E5&}Main Island, Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He jumped
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,onto the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't those dumb jerks\Nhave anything better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're running the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of you, head to the\Nmain island's front gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates forced it open and\Nare invading the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now that everyone else is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finally stop\Nrunning from these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's over there! Fire!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,80)\fscx175\fscy175\b600\bord2.2\xshad-1\yshad1\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(440,478)\t(399,440,\1a&H00&)\t(2192,2234,\1a&HFF&)}{Main Island\NIn Front of the Island Gate}Main Island\NAt the Island Gate
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(440,478)\fscx175\fscy175\bord0\blur0.8\b600\pos(960,80)\c&HE5E6E7&}{Main Island\NIn Front of the Island Gate}Main Island\NAt the Island Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the watchdogs, guards\Nof the island's front gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've run rampant for\Nfar too long, villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No criminal shall cross this line!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'd say they've got\Nus surrounded, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were they following us all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cocky little\Nscoundrel! All right, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could've let us have\Nsome fun first, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the reason you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your energy for the real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be here all day with that many guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kiddos are full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go save your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a King Bolt for Water 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freaky family coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch dogs back in formation immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can run away if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but our dogs aren't going to lose\Nto a couple of overgrown fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, they're gonna jump\Nup on the boat! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take the reins. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you see him, I want you\Nto pass on a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Galley-La!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving this one to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna skewer you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdrop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he took out those\Nwants dogs in one hit! Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just let their guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mere human can match our speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give them a taste of\Ncanine power, men! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't know what hit them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike like lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready for round two?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.26,0:10:59.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord2.5\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(478,0)\t(437,478,\1a&H00&)}Tower of Justice\NEnies Lobby
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.26,0:10:59.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(478,0)\fscx150\fscy150\bord0\blur0.8\b600\pos(960,675)\c&HE5E4E7&}Tower of Justice\NEnies Lobby
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems your temperament is as\Nvolatile as ever, cruddy flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we haven't\Nseen each other in years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it turns out that you've caused\Nme quite a bit of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faking your death and hiding\Nthe blueprints, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have arrested you\Nhad I known you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your old charges never\Nwere cleared, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of thorns in my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your old friend Iceberg has given\Nme quite the hassle as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bringing together all the shipbuilders\Nin Water 7 was quite crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The resulting Galley-La Company turned\Ninto a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though he must have resented the\Ngovernment, he allied with us all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before we knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were reliant on his company to\Nprovide ships for the entire navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only was he the president\Nof the Galley Law Company,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was also the mayor of Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, he was popular with the\Npublic and indispensable to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we dealt with him carelessly, there\Ncould have been severe repercussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that your\Ncompany's been contracted
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to build ships for the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate you helping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you after what they did to Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why he made a\Ndeal with those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit, he's a very clever man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had almost lost my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the wind hadn't blown\Nin my favor when it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was ready to resort to extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Admiral Aokiji said\Nsome good news my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that our little\Nfriend Nico Robin Was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a pirate ship headed\Nto Water 7 for repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I had to calm down and\Nthink about it over a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the Buster Call at my disposal,\Nit was quite easy to formulate a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:13:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little did I know the result would\Nexceed my wildest expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both the triggers needed to revive the\Nancient weapon are right here at my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say the winds of this\Nworld are blowing in my favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I most assuredly mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every man and every nation in\Nthe world must answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that power at the tip of my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Aokiji allow you\Nto invoke the Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to question me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get to play a part in\Nthe rebirth in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insolent witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you should even be\Nthanking me? Yeah. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cleanse this world of Ohana's\Nlegacy by bleeding. You draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen and listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you suffer\Npain so excruciatingly agonizing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you'll wake up every\Nmorning wishing you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hurt you and use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then throw you out into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A life as sinful as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deserves nothing less!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, I just\Nreceived some interesting news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, a moronic group of riffraff\Nhas decided to infiltrate our island?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a hapless attempt to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've been apprehended by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and his crew\Nwill trouble us no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're little more\Nthan insects compared to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the might of the 10,000\Nsoldiers of Eni's lobby
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conveniently,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were already preparing\Na prison transport ship
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What perfect timing they\Nhave Along with Cutty Flam,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll make a wonderful addition\NAs the latest inmates of Impel Down
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that wasn't part of our agreement In\Nexchange for my cooperation and surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you promised that you'd let\Nthe Straw Hats escape safely!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, what are you\Ngetting so worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucci, remind her of the exact\Nconditions that were offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terms of the arrangement\Nwere that excluding Nico Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat Pirates would be\Nallowed to leave Water 7 safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fairly straightforward, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After allowing them to leave\NWater 7 safely as promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats decided to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to break the heart of our\Nagreement over ridiculous technicality?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These dirtbags are the lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a shred of decency in any one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you filthy piece\Nof trash. We're not at any
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obligation to keep our promises\Nto a bunch of criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me you two don't get
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cocky with me we understand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deceiving and capturing\Npirates is what the navy does!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insolent wretch you're\Njust the idiot who fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll choose a fitting death for\None who spent her life lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deceiving, and betraying others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before the supreme power of\Njustice, resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least your friends will\Nsuffer and die with you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's all that commotion about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Sodom and Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep charging forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates that broke\Nthrough the main island's gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die,\Nget out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall back and then restore formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you stupid pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I got you, pirate lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smooth sailor, these two make it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going until we reach\Nour Captain King Bulls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape! He's alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surround him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander, this guy's really scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't falter, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring him down! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dead end's gotta be the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She better not have taken you away yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a C-PRISM stone\Nlock on her restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:20:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam goes to Impel Down and\NNico Robin to Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as the ship's ready, we'll\Nset sail through the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shall be done, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, take extra\Nprecautions with Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can be extremely violent...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Jabra been sighted? Help! Get him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That request is such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a report about it a\Nlittle while back, Cha-ba-ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he heard the news, Chief got\Nso worked up it was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said there were only five\Ncasualties, but that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The receiver is off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give us any trouble, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can return to your quarters for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this catch, Cape will\Nbe the toast of Navy headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our status will rise to incredible\Nheights, in a covert way, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that, I'd like to propose\Na little toast of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood for\Nsome ridiculous toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor am I interested in our\Nstatus or political influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our brand of justice is to assassinate\Nin the name of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as they continue to recognize\Nyou as the commander of Cape,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will fulfill our duty to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're under no obligation to\Nsupport your personal ideologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's a sound argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, what is it you want exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps all that we seek is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with CP9, we have\Nthe privilege to kill.

